Package: consensusR
Title: Client for the Consensus Academic Search API
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Ben Orwoll
Maintainer: Ben Orwoll <benhmin@gmail.com>
Description: A lightweight client for the Consensus (consensus.app)
    academic literature search API. Provides functions to query the
    api.consensus.app REST endpoint for peer-reviewed papers with
    relevance ranking, citation counts, study metadata, and journal
    quality signals, returning results as tibbles for use in downstream R
    analysis, Shiny applications, and Quarto reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
